TITLE Calcite kinetics: report moles at step 10
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2 charge
    pe 4
    units mmol/kgw
    Cu 10
    Ba 5
    -water 1

KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -m0 1.0
        -m  1.0
        -parms 1.0 1.0
        -step 10 in 10
        -tol 1e-12

RATES
Calcite
-start
10 k = 10
20 sa = PARM(1)
30 rate = k*sa
40 moles = rate*TIME
50 SAVE moles
-end

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file calcite_step10.sel
    -reset false
USER_PUNCH
    -head step	m_calcite
10 PUNCH STEP_NO, KIN("Calcite")
END
